 echangersai.org
DTSTAMP:20261127T180242Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261127T180242Z
SUMMARY:Chicano Prints — La Galería at UC Merced
DESCRIPTION:An exhibition of prints by Chicano artists from UC Merced’s p
 ermanent collection. Campus visitors and the public are welcome.\n\nCost: 
 Free admission. Weekday visitor parking is paid. Green Zone parking in the
  Bellevue Lot is free on weekends.\n\nExhibition through December 5. Regul
 ar gallery hours are Wednesday–Saturday\, noon–6 p.m. The gallery clos
 es for university holidays and academic breaks\, including the November 26
 –27 Thanksgiving holiday.\n\nSource: UC Merced Arts\nhttps://arts.ucmerc
 ed.edu/season
LOCATION:La Galería\, El Portal Residence Hall\, Room 120\, UC Merced\, 52
 00 Lake Road\, Merced\, CA 95343
CATEGORIES:Arts & performances
URL:https://arts.ucmerced.edu/season
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261014
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261206
END:VEVENT
