 y hours during exhibitions are Tuesday–Thursday\, 10:30 a.m.–3 p.m.\, 
 or by appointment. Check with the gallery for holiday hours.\n\nSource: Me
 rced College\nhttps://www.mccd.edu/event/art-gallery-exhibition-backyard-i
